<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Project Software cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Project Software cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>FAC Equities said it downgraded Project Software &amp; Development Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited lack of visibility of current sales growth and increasing operating costs.</p>
<p>-- also cited increasingly competitive market for maintenance solutions.</p>
<p>-- said believes there is downside risk to the third quarter earnings estimate of $0.18 a share.</p>
<p>-- said Project Software is in a favorable situation, with over $5 per share in cash, to grow its business through acquisition.</p>
<p>-- Project Software lost 1-3/8 to 15-1/8.</p>
</text>
